                        "Money is a medium of exchange.",
                        "Functions: exchange, unit, store, deferred payment.",
                        "Banks accept deposits and give loans.",
                        "Central bank controls the banking system.",
                        "RBI regulates money supply and credit.",
                        "Banks create credit in the economy."
