                        "Laws: Conservation of Mass, Definite Proportion, Multiple Proportions.",
                        "Atomic mass: relative mass; Molecular mass: sum of atomic masses.",
                        "Chemical formulas: molecular (actual) and empirical (simplest ratio).",
                        "Mole: 6.022 × 10²³ particles; molar mass in grams; used in calculations."
