                        "Types: asexual (single parent, identical offspring) and sexual (two parents, genetically different).",
                        "Asexual in animals: binary fission, budding, fragmentation, regeneration.",
                        "Sexual in animals: gametes fuse; fertilization internal/external; zygote → embryo → offspring.",
                        "Plants: asexual – vegetative propagation; sexual – pollination → fertilization → seeds."
