                        "Heart & vessels: arteries, veins, capillaries; blood components – plasma, RBCs, WBCs, platelets.",
                        "Human circulation: double circulation (pulmonary & systemic), 4-chambered heart, valves prevent backflow, blood pressure.",
                        "Lymphatic system: returns tissue fluid, immunity, fat absorption.",
